                                "sense_id": "088f7115-0601-39ee-8043-4a49e7326970",
                                "text": "Roland called, looking across the street at what a large false-fronted sign proclaimed to be the Good Beds Hotel. \"Hello, the town!\" No answer but the bells, the tunesome insects, and that odd wooden clunking."
                            },
