                                "sense_id": "088f7115-0601-39ee-8043-4a49e7326970",
                                "text": "Though pleased to make acquaintance of those tunesome brothers, they were infinitely more enamoured of its second billing, their Holy Father, Bo Diddley, whom they welcomed with the awe of Israelites; [...]"
